# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What is NOT published to GitHub
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Dotfiles and tool folders (only this .gitignore is published)
.*
!.gitignore

# Notes for the coding assistant (local only)
CLAUDE.md

# Python environment and caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Data: raw downloads (LGL open data, HNVG meter and radio data) and everything generated from it.
# The HNVG meter data must not be published without HNVG's approval.
data/
web/data/
cities/*/raw/
cities/*/processed/
cities/*/web_data/

# Large media and presentations – the README uses the small copies in docs/media/
docs/*
!docs/media/
*.pptx
*.mp3
